.TH GAD-DOLPHIN-PASTE 1 "November 2026" "Gad 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gad-dolphin-paste \- manage Gad paste integration in Dolphin
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gad-dolphin-paste
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
This helper updates the current user's Dolphin shortcut settings.
It is normally invoked by the Gad settings menu.
Use the Gad graphical settings to enable or disable paste integration.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Display supported operations.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gad (1)
